WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Three little pigs set off to build
homes of their own.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
One chose straw, another chose wood,
and the third chose bricks.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
The first little pig quickly built
a straw house.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
That evening, the wind rustled
through the straw roof.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
The second little pig made a house
out of wooden boards.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
The boards shook every time
the wind blew.

00:30.000 --> 00:35.000
The third little pig patiently
laid his bricks one by one.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
By evening, he had a sturdy house
with a strong front door.

00:40.000 --> 00:45.000
The wolf huffed and puffed,
and straw flew across the meadow.

00:45.000 --> 00:50.000
The first little pig made it
safely to his brother’s house.

00:50.000 --> 00:55.000
The wolf huffed again.
The wooden house fell apart.

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
The two brothers ran
to the red brick house.

01:00.000 --> 01:05.000
The wolf blew as hard as he could.
The brick house did not move.

01:05.000 --> 01:10.000
Behind the strong door,
all three little pigs were safe.

01:10.000 --> 01:15.000
The next morning, the pigs
invited the wolf to tea.

01:15.000 --> 01:20.000
They made peace and promised
to help each other.
